+  "an8.54:5.5": "If a lay person has a small income but maintains a grand livelihood, it will be rumored of him, ‘This clansman devours his wealth like a fruit-tree eater .’ ",
   "an8.54:5.6": "If a lay person has a large income but maintains a miserable livelihood, it will be rumored of him, ‘This clansman will die of starvation.’ ",
   "an8.54:5.7": "But when a lay person, knowing the income and outflow of his wealth, maintains a livelihood in tune, neither a spendthrift nor a penny-pincher, (thinking,) ‘Thus will my income exceed my outflow, and my outflow will not exceed my income,’ ",
   "an8.54:5.8": "this is called maintaining one’s livelihood in tune. ",
